Death From Above				KEY:Aerial Avenger ~ Death From Above					CATEGORY:Special Ability		TYPE:SpecialAttack.Extraordinary	ASPECT:NAME|Death From Above +%1|DeathFromAbove		DEFINE:DeathFromAbove|0	DESC:+%1 competence bonus to attacks if in the air above a foe.		BONUS:VAR|DeathFromAbove|1|PREVARGTEQ:AerialAvengerLevel,4		BONUS:VAR|DeathFromAbove|1|PREVARGTEQ:AerialAvengerLevel,9
Range Increase					KEY:Aerial Avenger ~ Range Increase						CATEGORY:Special Ability		TYPE:SpecialQuality.Extraordinary	DESC:Increase the range increment of weapons and the range of attack spells by 50%% while airborne.
Swoop							KEY:Aerial Avenger ~ Swoop								CATEGORY:Special Ability		TYPE:SpecialAttack.Extraordinary	DESC:As a full-round action, fly in a straight line, move your full speed and make a melee attack against any foe within reach on the path.  For each foe beyond the first, all attacks suffer a -1 penalty, so the Aerial Avenger must declare the number of targets at the beginning of the attack, minimum 2.  The Aerial Avenger gives up her normal attacks to take this action, and this movement does not provoke attacks of opportunity.  
Terrifying Shriek				KEY:Aerial Avenger ~ Terrifying Shriek					CATEGORY:Special Ability		TYPE:SpecialAttack.Extraordinary	DESC:Add a shrill shriek to any Swoop attack.  All creatures within 50' of the first attack must make a DC %1 Will save, or be panicked for 1d6+4 rounds.|20+CHA






