Astral Tracking						CATEGORY:FEAT		TYPE:Bloodline		DESC:You can track a creature normally through the Astral [base Survival DC 25].  When standing th the location [on any plane] where a creature departed by means of Teleportation, you can determine the destination with a DC 30 survival check.  If you  have your own means of teleportation, you can teleport to that location as if you had viewed it once. 
Axiomatic Bloodline					CATEGORY:FEAT		TYPE:Bloodline					PRESPELLCAST:MEMORIZE=N,TYPE=Arcane		DESC:Gain known Law spells.  Cannot cast Chaos spells.		SPELLKNOWN:CLASS|SPELLCASTER.Arcane=1|Detect Chaos				SPELLKNOWN:CLASS|SPELLCASTER.Arcane=2|Locate Object				SPELLKNOWN:CLASS|SPELLCASTER.Arcane=3|Magic Circle Against Chaos				SPELLKNOWN:CLASS|SPELLCASTER.Arcane=4|Locate Creature				SPELLKNOWN:CLASS|SPELLCASTER.Arcane=5|Dismissal				SPELLKNOWN:CLASS|SPELLCASTER.Arcane=6|True Seeing				SPELLKNOWN:CLASS|SPELLCASTER.Arcane=7|Forcecage			SPELLKNOWN:CLASS|SPELLCASTER.Arcane=8|Discern Location		SPELLKNOWN:CLASS|SPELLCASTER.Arcane=9|Dominate Monster
Bend Spell							CATEGORY:FEAT		TYPE:Metamagic				ADDSPELLLEVEL:1			DESC:Target of this spell gets no AC bonus or Save bonus against this spell due to cover.  This does not allow you to target creatures with total cover. 
Braced For Charge					CATEGORY:FEAT		TYPE:General				DESC:Allows you to set a polearm against a charge for double damage - with weapons that do not normally do double damage against a charge. 
