Dance of Reckess Bravery		CATEGORY:Special Ability		TYPE:SpecialQuality.Supernatural		DESC:If you have at least 5 ranks in Tumble, you can take a move action that grants your allies within 30' a +4 bonus on saves vs fear effects for [5+your Charisma bonus = %1] rounds.|5+CHA
Dance of The Vexing Snake		CATEGORY:Special Ability		TYPE:SpecialQuality.Supernatural		DESC:If you have at least 8 ranks in Tumble, you can move at normal speed while tumbling.  
Dancer's Strike				CATEGORY:Special Ability		TYPE:SpecialAttack.Supernatural		DESC:As a standard action your unarmed attacks count as magical for piercing damage reduction for %1 (5+your Charisma Modifier)rounds|5+CHA|PREVARLT:BattleDancerLVL,12			DESC:As a standard action your unarmed attacks count as magical and aligned for piercing damage reduction for %1 (5+your Charisma Modifier)rounds|5+CHA|PREVARGTEQ:BattleDancerLVL,12|PREVARLT:BattleDancerLVL,18			DESC:As a standard action your unarmed attacks count as magical, aligned, and of a particular material/additional alignment for piercing damage reduction for %1 (5+your Charisma Modifier)rounds|5+CHA|PREVARGTEQ:BattleDancerLVL,18	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Dancer's Strike Alignment|1|PREVARGTEQ:BattleDancerLVL,12	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Dancer's Strike Material|1|PREVARGTEQ:BattleDancerLVL,18	
