Dance of the Floating Step		CATEGORY:Special Ability		TYPE:SpecialQuality.Supernatural		DESC:If you have at least 11 ranks in Tumble, you can run across the surface of a liquid like water or magma without taking damage or sinking below the surface.  If you end your movement on the liquid, you take damage/sink as normal.  You must begin your movement on a solid, stable surface.
Dance of the Crushing Python		CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Supernatural		DESC:If you have at least 17 ranks in Tumble, you can use the Tumble skill to enter an opponent's space without provoking an attack of opportunity and you may attack that opponent while there.  If you r attak hits, they take a penalty of -2 to armor class and cannot make attacks of opportunity untin the start ofyour next turn.  After the attack resolves, you enter the square of your choice adjacent to the opponent.
Dance of the Soaring Eagle			CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Supernatural		DESC:If you have at least 20 ranks in Tumble, you gain a Fly speed equal to your base speed with Average maneuverability.  If you make an aerial charge on an opponent below you, you get +4 to attack and +2 damage instead of the normal benefits of charging.  You may combine Dance of the Springing Tiger with this.  
Dance of the Springing Tiger	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Supernatural			DESC:If oyu have at least 14 ranks in Tumble, you may make a DC 20 tumble check as part of a charge.  If you succeed, you may make a Full Attack instead of a Standard Attack as part of the charge.
Dance of Death's Embrace	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Supernatural		DESC:If you have at least 23 ranks in Tumble, you can make a DC35 tumble check as a Full Round action, and designate a target within 30'.  If you succeed the check, your successful attacks against the target deal +2d6 damage, and any critical threats are automatically confirmed.